msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:437
#: b9e913de22fe43dab6c410372dc266af
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used"
" for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 "
"which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this"
" manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚映射到定时器输入而非 UART，可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 "
"除外——它们需要真正的 UART 连接。不过 FPort 以这种方式连接时，可提供 RC 但没有数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:439
#: 223db008365f412d9b45c4479dbc0de3
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART must be used. For example, UART1 can have its "
"protocol changed from the default GPS protocol for GPS2 to RX input "
"protocol:"
msgstr ""
"要使用 CRSF 以及 Fport、CRSF、SRXL2 接收机内嵌的数传，必须使用完整的 UART。例如可把 UART1 的协议从默认的 GPS2 用"
" GPS 协议改为 RX 输入协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:441
#: 9522dc031bf44ee5b59a072ecadf76a3
msgid "With this option, SERIAL4_PROTOCOL must be set to “23”, and:"
msgstr "选择此选项时，SERIAL4_PROTOCOL 必须设置为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:443
#: 76f0e32df2cb482890aca8ea39d1d421
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:444
#: 723c0f8ffeb643c7ad9fe2cc5c329831
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX1 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX1 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:445
#: fe655470603c439d973ad6226865171d
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX1 and RX1. See FPort Receivers."
msgstr "FPort 需要同时连接 TX1 和 RX1。请参阅 FPort 接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:446
#: 4e27a3c7f0fc4812a4e27bddfc8e9d10
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX1 外还需要连接 TX1，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:447
#: f6bae24801db4ae1913911a29058a526
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" SERIAL4_OPTIONS to “4”."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要连接 TX1 并自动提供数传。将 SERIAL4_OPTIONS 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:449
#: ebb554f1082640e6a8c59d2e1867f6f0
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See Radio Control Systems for "
"details."
msgstr "ArduPilot 中任何 UART 均可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议。详见无线电控制系统文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:452
#: cddfa961fcf24115854709e1611fd9a7
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:454
#: 3c9ee1b8ac4a43a5acadfb3f9ded110d
msgid ""
"The A6Ultra supports up to 13 PWM outputs,support all PWM protocols. All 13 "
"PWM outputs have GND on the bottom row, 5V on the middle row and Signal on "
"the top row."
msgstr ""
"A6Ultra 最多支持 13 路 PWM 输出，支持所有 PWM 协议。所有 13 路 PWM 输出底排为 GND，中排为 5V，顶排为信号线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:456
#: 42c0b43e764747a79c32a3ee88170ddd
msgid "The 13 PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "13 路 PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:459
#: 9bccf75b6de44d1ea993051d52da3b00
msgid "PWM 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2、3、4 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:460
#: 07455ff65a7d4afb881860fa75145c1c
msgid "PWM 5, 6, 7 and 8 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5、6、7、8 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:461
#: 0a4bb7ea49cb4b9b95e198cab9847bcc
msgid "PWM 9, 10, 11 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 9、10、11 为第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:462
#: 5886500dbbe4431b9273e17d84d0be29
msgid "PWM 12, 13 in group4 (PWM only)"
msgstr "PWM 12、13 为第 4 组（仅 PWM）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:464
#: 01ec045088314ea8b07f31df21173e4b
msgid ""
"Channels 1-8 support bi-directional Dshot. Channels 1-11 support DShot. "
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot, then all channels in that group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr ""
"通道 1–8 支持双向 DShot；通道 1–11 支持 DShot。同组通道必须使用相同的输出速率。若同组中任一通道使用 "
"DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用 DShot。"

